学习成本，复制对应协议链接，写入所选客户端，即刻建立连接。所有配额均透明呈现，按月或按年计费，自由变更。\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"hero-nav\">\n        <a href=\"#plans\">订阅方案</a>\n        <a href=\"#setup\">客户端设置</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <section id=\"plans\">\n      <h2>可选服务方案</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">阶梯配额。灵活升级。用多少选多少。</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"plans-stepped\">\n        <article class=\"plan-card\">\n          <h3 class=\"plan-name\">基础版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-box\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price\">¥15<span>/月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-btn\">订购基础版</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-card featured\">\n          <div class=\"plan-badge\">推荐选择</div>\n          <h3 class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-box\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price\">¥35<span>/月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n            <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-btn\">订购旗舰版</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-card\">\n          <h3 class=\"plan-name\">团队版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-box\">\n            <div class=\"plan-price\">¥85<span>/月</span></div>\n            <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n            <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-btn\">订购团队版</a>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"setup\">\n      <h2>使用说明</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">三步完成全平台通用接入流程。</p>\n      <div class=\"steps-grid\">\n        <div class=\"step-card\">\n          <div class=\"step-index\">01</div>\n          <h3 class=\"step-title\">获取订阅链接</h3>\n          <p class=\"step-body\">选定对应服务方案并结算。进入控制台复制专属配置地址。妥善保管，切勿泄漏。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-card\">\n          <div class=\"step-index\">02</div>\n          <h3 class=\"step-title\">导入常用客户端</h3>\n          <p class=\"step-body\">本站不绑定专属软件。支持标准代理协议，可在常用客户端中新建配置并粘贴订阅。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-card\">\n          <div class=\"step-index\">03</div>\n          <h3 class=\"step-title\">更新并启用分流</h3>\n          <p class=\"step-body\">下载节点列表后开启系统路由。建议选择规则模式，国内流量直连，海外流量代理。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"faq\">\n      <h2>常见问题</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-desc\">围绕订阅管理与日常连接的说明。</p>\n      <div class=\"faq-groups\">\n        <div class=\"faq-group\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">订阅与账户</h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-question\">流量用尽后如何处理？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">服务将在配额归零后自动暂停。可在控制台购买流量重置包，或等待账单日自动刷新。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-question\">同时在线设备数如何判定？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">系统按实时发起连接的独立 IP 或客户端会话统计。超出配额将阻断新设备接入。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-question\">是否支持随时更改套餐？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">支持补差价升级至更高阶套餐。变更实时生效，剩余周期按日折算。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-group\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-group-title\">连接与维护</h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-question\">支持哪些操作系统？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">只要客户端支持主流中继协议，均可在 Windows、macOS、iOS、Android 及 Linux 导入。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-question\">节点列表无法更新怎么办？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">请检查本地系统时间是否准确。确认网络环境未屏蔽订阅域名后再次尝试手动拉取。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-question\">是否限制单线程下载速率？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">系统不对单线程强行限速。实际速度取决于本地运营商互联带宽及节点负载情况。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      绝绝子 - 简洁务实的中继管理。请遵循当地法律法规合理使用网络。\n    </footer>\n  </main>",
